{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15105","headline":"置酒行 · 李益","name":"置酒行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"置酒命所欢，凭觞遂爲戚。\n日往不再来，兹辰坐成昔。\n百龄非久长，五十将半百。\n胡爲劳我形，已须还复白。\n西山鸾鹤羣，矫矫烟雾翮。\n明霞发金丹，阴洞潜水碧。\n安得凌风羽，崦嵫驻灵魄。\n无然坐衰老，慙叹东陵柏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15105.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15105","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}